OL,3,GNEWSAWhy council leader is facing a
OL,4,Ano-confidence vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Liberal Democrat leader of
OL,7,FHuntingdonshire District Council faces
OL,8,Fa motion of no confidence on Tuesday
OL,9,Fevening.
OL,11,FThe move against Sarah Conboy has been
OL,12,Fmade by Ross Martin, the leader of the
OL,13,FConservative opposition. He says it's
OL,14,Fover the handling of proposals to
OL,15,Fredevelop parts of St Ives, St Neots
OL,16,Fand Huntingdon.
OL,18,FIt comes just weeks after two Green
OL,19,Fparty councillors left the joint
OL,20,Fadministration, led by the Liberal
OL,21,FDemocrats, over the same issue.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
