OL,3,GNEWSAWhy council leader is facing a
OL,4,Ano-confidence vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Lib Dems are the largest party at
OL,7,Fthe council with 21 out of the 52
OL,8,Favailable seats. After May's local
OL,9,Felection they formed a coalition with
OL,10,Fthe Greens and Independents.
